    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/01c0a353261bca3a41edb255c2cef9af.avif?t=1745621290\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make It Your Own Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apu's Journey</strong> is a retro action-RPG inspired by the golden era of adventure games!<br>Conquer challenging dungeons, defeat mysterious creatures, collect secret items, and unlock new abilities to forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey full of discovery and nostalgia, set in a world styled after the classic Game Boy era!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/56af60d95a127de86d75a1b8acbee962.avif?t=1745621290\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/a2482380406ca87076523e13759e98eb.avif?t=1745621290\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of puzzles, action, and exploration in a top-down style inspired by classics like <i>The Legend of Zelda</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochromatic pixel art with selectable color palettes to recreate the old-school handheld atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system: unlock dozens of hidden feats as you explore every corner of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty modes: play casually or push your limits with intense challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support: experience the retro feeling in the most authentic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/56af60d95a127de86d75a1b8acbee962.avif?t=1745621290\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/61c1d4e48dffd4f6ecf2584c7345b0e6.avif?t=1745621290\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Ancient Creature Awaits...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Apu defeat <strong>The One Who Wears Shadows</strong> and destroy the three sealed masks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're ready, prepare yourself for a journey that echoes the nostalgia of the classics!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/01c0a353261bca3a41edb255c2cef9af.avif?t=1745621290\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make It Your Own Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apu's Journey</strong> is a retro action-RPG inspired by the golden era of adventure games!<br>Conquer challenging dungeons, defeat mysterious creatures, collect secret items, and unlock new abilities to forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey full of discovery and nostalgia, set in a world styled after the classic Game Boy era!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/56af60d95a127de86d75a1b8acbee962.avif?t=1745621290\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/a2482380406ca87076523e13759e98eb.avif?t=1745621290\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of puzzles, action, and exploration in a top-down style inspired by classics like <i>The Legend of Zelda</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochromatic pixel art with selectable color palettes to recreate the old-school handheld atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement system: unlock dozens of hidden feats as you explore every corner of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty modes: play casually or push your limits with intense challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support: experience the retro feeling in the most authentic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/56af60d95a127de86d75a1b8acbee962.avif?t=1745621290\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/61c1d4e48dffd4f6ecf2584c7345b0e6.avif?t=1745621290\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Ancient Creature Awaits...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help Apu defeat <strong>The One Who Wears Shadows</strong> and destroy the three sealed masks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're ready, prepare yourself for a journey that echoes the nostalgia of the classics!</p>",
